WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.799 --> 00:00:15.119
landed in Metro City Park.

2
00:00:15.139 --> 00:00:17.661
"It's Rocket Girl!"

3
00:00:17.861 --> 00:00:18.441
cried Mara.

4
00:00:19.242 --> 00:00:20.162
Roxy looked around.

5
00:00:21.143 --> 00:00:23.244
Monster dogs and cats were everywhere!

6
00:00:24.545 --> 00:00:26.466
Several monster pets were on the tennis court.

7
00:00:27.467 --> 00:00:29.368
The court was surrounded by a tall fence.

8
00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:32.842
A monster cat hissed at a man selling balloons.

9
00:00:33.883 --> 00:00:36.025
The cat jumped up and stuck out its claws.

10
00:00:36.685 --> 00:00:37.446
Pop! Pop!

11
00:00:37.786 --> 00:00:40.228
Pop! The cat popped all the balloons.

12
00:00:41.149 --> 00:00:45.733
"My balloons are ruined!"

13
00:00:46.053 --> 00:00:46.974
cried the balloon man.

14
00:00:47.955 --> 00:00:49.476
Roxy noticed the cat's collar.

15
00:00:50.157 --> 00:00:50.777
It was glowing.

16
00:00:53.019 --> 00:00:55.982
"MEOW!" Roxy spun around.

17
00:00:56.742 --> 00:00:58.624
Another monster cat was creeping toward her!

18
00:01:00.052 --> 00:01:00.852
Roxy gasped.

19
00:01:00.872 --> 00:01:03.494
"It has a glowing collar too!"

20
00:01:04.074 --> 00:01:09.076
Phwoof! The cat shot a flaming hairball toward Roxy.

21
00:01:10.257 --> 00:01:12.618
Roxy made a fist and—bam!

22
00:01:13.298 --> 00:01:14.538
She knocked the hairball away.

23
00:01:14.558 --> 00:01:17.040
"Help, Rocket Girl!"

24
00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:17.920
cried Terrell.

25
00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:20.021
Roxy glanced back at her friends.

26
00:01:21.261 --> 00:01:23.883
Two monster dogs were growling and moving toward them!

27
00:01:25.943 --> 00:01:27.044
Roxy whistled loudly.

28
00:01:27.904 --> 00:01:29.946
The dogs turned and charged toward Roxy.

29
00:01:30.866 --> 00:01:33.528
She ran to the tennis court and stood in front of the open gate.

30
00:01:33.548 --> 00:01:38.672
"GRR!" The dogs growled and raced toward Roxy.

31
00:01:39.592 --> 00:01:41.534
Just before they reached her, she jumped up.

32
00:01:42.074 --> 00:01:43.735
The dogs tumbled onto the tennis court.

33
00:01:43.755 --> 00:01:49.319
"Ha!" cried Roxy as she slammed shut the gate.

34
00:01:49.739 --> 00:01:52.441
Terrell, Mara, and Jack cheered.

35
00:01:52.461 --> 00:01:55.523
"Yay, Rocket Girl!"

36
00:01:55.723 --> 00:01:56.304
cried Mara.

37
00:01:57.352 --> 00:01:58.733
Roxy zoomed into the air.

38
00:01:58.753 --> 00:02:05.637
"Those glowing collars must be turning pets into monsters," she thought.

39
00:02:05.657 --> 00:02:09.559
"Ralphie's owner said she got the glowing collar from Mr.

40
00:02:09.679 --> 00:02:12.381
Snippy. But where is Mr.

41
00:02:12.461 --> 00:02:13.962
Snippy's Pet Salon?"

42
00:02:14.622 --> 00:02:17.164
Just then a man yelled, "Bad dog, Buster!"

43
00:02:18.064 --> 00:02:18.965
Roxy looked down.

44
00:02:20.545 --> 00:02:21.886
The man was missing a shoe.

45
00:02:22.727 --> 00:02:24.668
He was wagging a finger at a monster dog.

46
00:02:25.612 --> 00:02:28.293
The dog was chewing on something as his collar glowed.

47
00:02:29.233 --> 00:02:30.573
Roxy flew down to the man.

48
00:02:30.593 --> 00:02:32.254
"Excuse me.

49
00:02:32.834 --> 00:02:33.874
Is this your dog?"

50
00:02:35.035 --> 00:02:36.235
"Yes," said the man.

51
00:02:36.255 --> 00:02:37.895
"And he's very bad!

52
00:02:38.656 --> 00:02:39.616
He just ate my shoe!"

53
00:02:39.636 --> 00:02:43.937
"Did you get that collar from Mr.

54
00:02:44.037 --> 00:02:45.377
Snippy's Pet Salon?"

55
00:02:46.178 --> 00:02:48.038
"Yes." The man looked surprised.

56
00:02:48.058 --> 00:02:49.359
"How did you know?"

57
00:02:49.379 --> 00:02:52.039
"Never mind," said Roxy.

58
00:02:52.059 --> 00:02:54.420
"Just tell me where the salon is."

59
00:02:55.264 --> 00:02:57.325
The man told Roxy the salon's address.

60
00:02:58.986 --> 00:03:00.427
Roxy zipped through the air again.

61
00:03:01.467 --> 00:03:03.709
A moment later she threw open the salon's doors.

62
00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:07.791
A thin man with a bow tie spun around.

63
00:03:08.691 --> 00:03:10.392
He wore gloves with sharp blades.

64
00:03:11.653 --> 00:03:15.255
When he saw Roxy, his lips curled into a nasty smile.

65
00:03:15.275 --> 00:03:17.396
"Welcome to Mr.

66
00:03:17.436 --> 00:03:18.797
Snippy's, Rocket Girl!"

67
00:03:19.517 --> 00:03:21.238
His sharp blades clacked loudly.

68
00:03:21.258 --> 00:03:24.059
"I suppose you're here for a cut!"
